[gd_scene format=3]

; The Undercroft, under the cathedral east of the Sluice (map offset (236.5, -8.5)): the crypts, the second hub.
; A low metal vault over the west door, a pilgrim shrine, a sunken crypt with two tombs and a Votary mourning
; over them, and a tall east wall. East at floor level: the Ossuary. High in the east wall: the way on to the
; Chapterhouse, on a metal ledge: climb the metal wall and wrap around the ledge (Mag-grip), or harpoon the two
; mooring rings (Harpoon). Above the west door a metal flue rises to the Scriptorium (Mag-grip). Coming back
; from either is a drop. The lift up from the frozen layer (the Counterweight) will arrive here.

